tured without biases. There is a call for collaboration among different benchmarking initiatives and the community, encouraging innovative methods like crowdsourcing for evaluating foundation models. A specific exercise using talks, large language models, and crowdsourced evaluation is also detailed, aiming to refine benchmarking approaches collaboratively."}, "real_rankings": {"openai": 1, "perplexity": 2}, "real_quality_scores": {}, "question_difficulty": "Easy"}
